Aspect <code>@Controller</code> <code>@RestController</code> Purpose Web MVC with views REST API Return value View name (String) Body (serialized) <code>@ResponseBody</code> Must add per method Implicit Introduced Spring 2.5 Spring 4.0 Composed of <code>@Component</code> <code>@Controller</code> + <code>@ResponseBody</code> <pre><code>// @Controller — returns view name "users/list"
