namedJdbc.batchUpdate("INSERT INTO users (name, email) VALUES (:name, :email)", sources);
</code></pre>

Batch Performance Tips <ul> <li>Batch size 500–5000 typically optimal</li> <li>Use <code>rewriteBatchedStatements=true</code> for MySQL</li> <li>Batch <code>INSERT</code>, <code>UPDATE</code>, <code>DELETE</code> — not <code>SELECT</code></li> <li>Use transactions to avoid per-statement commit</li> </ul> <pre><code>@Transactional
public void insertMany(List&lt;User&gt; users) { batchInsert(users); }
</code></pre>

