Strategy Use Case <code>IDENTITY</code> Auto-increment column (MySQL, PostgreSQL) <code>SEQUENCE</code> DB sequence (Oracle, PostgreSQL) <code>TABLE</code> Table-based (portable, slow) <code>AUTO</code> Provider chooses (Hibernate → SEQUENCE or TABLE) <code>UUID</code> Hibernate 6 supports UUID natively <pre><code>// IDENTITY
@Id @GeneratedValue(strategy = GenerationType.IDENTITY)
private Long id;

// SEQUENCE
@Id
@GeneratedValue(strategy = GenerationType.SEQUENCE, generator = "user_seq")
@SequenceGenerator(name = "user_seq", sequenceName = "users_seq", allocationSize = 50)
private Long id;

// UUID
@Id
@GeneratedValue(strategy = GenerationType.UUID)
private UUID id;
</code></pre> <p>Important: <code>IDENTITY</code> disables JDBC batch inserts (Hibernate can't know ID before insert). Use <code>SEQUENCE</code> for batch inserts.</p>

